#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:650
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Hello, space traveler!  It's a pleasure to see {source_callsign} docking "
"with us.  How can we make your stay on {target_callsign} more comfortable?"
msgstr ""
"Hallo, Raumfahrer!  Es freut uns, {source_callsign} bei uns andocken zu "
"sehen.  Wie können wir Ihren Aufenthalt auf {target_callsign} angenehmer "
"gestalten?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:652
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Greetings, cosmic colleague!  {source_callsign}'s docking is a cause for "
"celebration here on {target_callsign}.  Any messages or updates to share?"
msgstr ""
"Seid gegrüßt, kosmischer Kollege!  Das Andocken von {source_callsign} ist "
"hier auf {target_callsign} ein Grund zum Feiern.  Haben Sie Nachrichten oder "
"Neuigkeiten für uns?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:654
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Good day, starfaring friend!  Your arrival is like a cosmic reunion for "
"{target_callsign}.  Any tales from your travels?"
msgstr ""
"Guten Tag, Sternenreisender!  Ihre Ankunft ist für {target_callsign} wie ein "
"kosmisches Wiedersehen.  Haben Sie Geschichten von Ihren Reisen zu erzählen?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:656
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Salutations, fellow communicator!  {source_callsign} has reached "
"{target_callsign} safe and sound.  Anything exciting to share from your "
"journey?"
msgstr ""
"Seid gegrüßt, Kommunikationskollege!  {source_callsign} hat "
"{target_callsign} sicher erreicht.  Gibt es etwas Aufregendes von Ihrer "
"Reise zu berichten?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:658
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Hello there!  Welcome to {target_callsign}.  It's fantastic to have you on "
"board."
msgstr ""
"Hallo!  Willkommen auf {target_callsign}.  Es ist großartig, Sie an Bord zu "
"haben."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:660
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Hello, astral envoy!  {source_callsign} has made a stellar entrance.  Any "
"interesting discoveries on your voyage to {target_callsign}?"
msgstr ""
"Hallo, astraler Gesandter!  {source_callsign} hat einen wahrhaft stellaren "
"Auftritt hingelegt.  Haben Sie auf Ihrer Reise nach {target_callsign} "
"interessante Entdeckungen gemacht?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:662
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Salutations, space traveler!  {source_callsign}'s arrival marks another "
"chapter in {target_callsign}'s cosmic adventures.  How can we assist you "
"today?"
msgstr ""
"Seid gegrüßt, Raumfahrer!  Die Ankunft von {source_callsign} ist ein "
"weiteres Kapitel in den kosmischen Abenteuern von {target_callsign}.  Wie "
"können wir Ihnen heute behilflich sein?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:664
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Welcome, {source_callsign}!  It's a pleasure to see you docking with "
"{target_callsign}.  How's the cosmic voyage treating you?"
msgstr ""
"Willkommen, {source_callsign}!  Es freut uns, Sie bei {target_callsign} "
"andocken zu sehen.  Wie ist Ihre kosmische Reise verlaufen?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:666
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Hello there, {source_callsign}!  Your arrival brings a new energy to "
"{target_callsign}.  How was your journey?"
msgstr ""
"Hallo, {source_callsign}!  Ihre Ankunft bringt neue Energie nach "
"{target_callsign}.  Wie war Ihre Reise?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:668
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Greetings, {source_callsign}!  Welcome to our space station.  It's an honor "
"to have you on board."
msgstr ""
"Seid gegrüßt, {source_callsign}!  Willkommen auf unserer Raumstation.  Es "
"ist uns eine Ehre, Sie an Bord zu haben."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:670
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Hello, relay officer.  I suppose we should acknowledge the docking of "
"{source_callsign}, as unremarkable as it may be."
msgstr ""
"Hallo, Kommunikationsoffizier.  Ich nehme an, wir sollten das Andocken von "
"{source_callsign} zur Kenntnis nehmen, so unspektakulär es auch sein mag."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:672
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Welcome, spacefaring communicator.  {source_callsign} docks, and the cosmos "
"barely flinches.  How typical."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen, Raumfahrt-Kommunikator.  {source_callsign} dockt an, und der "
"Kosmos zuckt kaum mit der Wimper.  Wie typisch."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:674
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Ah, the celestial messenger has arrived.  Do enlighten us with tales of "
"{source_callsign}'s travels, if you must."
msgstr ""
"Ah, der himmlische Bote ist eingetroffen.  Erhellen Sie uns doch, wenn es "
"denn sein muss, mit Geschichten von {source_callsign}s Reisen."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:676
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Well, well, if it isn't {source_callsign}.  I trust your journey was at "
"least mildly tolerable."
msgstr ""
"Nun, nun, wenn das nicht {source_callsign} ist.  Ich hoffe, Ihre Reise war "
"zumindest einigermaßen erträglich."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:678
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Ah, the starship {source_callsign} graces us with its presence.  How "
"quaint.  Welcome to our humble space station."
msgstr ""
"Ah, das Raumschiff {source_callsign} beehrt uns mit seiner Anwesenheit.  Wie "
"reizend.  Willkommen auf unserer bescheidenen Raumstation."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:680
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Welcome, spacefaring communicator.  I hope {source_callsign}'s visit won't "
"disrupt {target_callsign}'s delicate equilibrium too much."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen, Raumfahrt-Kommunikator.  Ich hoffe, der Besuch von "
"{source_callsign} wird das empfindliche Gleichgewicht von {target_callsign} "
"nicht allzu sehr stören."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:682
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Salutations, celestial correspondent.  {source_callsign}'s docking disrupted "
"our routine.  What urgent message do you bring, if any?"
msgstr ""
"Seid gegrüßt, himmlischer Korrespondent.  Das Andocken von {source_callsign} "
"hat unsere Routine gestört.  Welche dringende Nachricht bringen Sie, wenn "
"überhaupt?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:684
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Hello there, {source_callsign}.  Your arrival was as eagerly anticipated as "
"a space debris collision.  What's the news?"
msgstr ""
"Hallo, {source_callsign}.  Ihre Ankunft wurde mit ebenso großer Begeisterung "
"erwartet wie eine Kollision mit Weltraumschrott.  Was gibt es Neues?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:686
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Well, look who decided to drop by.  What cosmic inconvenience brings "
"{source_callsign} to {target_callsign} today?"
msgstr ""
"Na, sehen Sie mal, wer sich zu uns verirrt hat.  Welche kosmische "
"Unannehmlichkeit führt {source_callsign} heute nach {target_callsign}?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:688
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Oh, joy.  The starship {source_callsign} has graced us with their presence.  "
"What brings you here?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, welch Freude.  Das Raumschiff {source_callsign} beehrt uns mit seiner "
"Anwesenheit.  Was führt Sie hierher?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:690
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Greetings, stellar correspondent.  {source_callsign}'s docking is a source "
"of mild irritation.  What cosmic drama unfolds now?"
msgstr ""
"Seid gegrüßt, stellarer Korrespondent.  Das Andocken von {source_callsign} "
"ist eine Quelle leichter Verärgerung.  Welches kosmische Drama spielt sich "
"nun ab?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:692
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Welcome aboard, cosmic messenger.  {source_callsign}'s docking better have a "
"good reason.  We have enough on our plate without your cosmic theatrics."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen an Bord, kosmischer Bote.  Das Andocken von {source_callsign} "
"sollte einen guten Grund haben.  Wir haben auch ohne Ihre kosmatische "
"Theatralik schon genug um die Ohren."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:694
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Hello, starbound emissary.  {source_callsign}'s presence is less of a "
"pleasure and more of a cosmic headache.  What brings you to "
"{target_callsign}?"
msgstr ""
"Hallo, sternengebundener Gesandter.  Die Anwesenheit von {source_callsign} "
"ist weniger ein Vergnügen als vielmehr ein kosmischer Kopfschmerz.  Was "
"führt Sie nach {target_callsign}?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:696
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-docked"
msgid ""
"Salutations, interstellar nuisance.  {source_callsign}'s docking is the last "
"thing we needed.  What pressing crisis are you here to address?"
msgstr ""
"Seid gegrüßt, interstelläre Plage.  Das Andocken von {source_callsign} ist "
"das Letzte, was wir jetzt gebraucht haben.  Welche dringende Krise wollen "
"Sie hier lösen?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:705
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"This is {target_callsign}'s communications officer.  Go ahead, "
"{source_callsign}.  We're listening."
msgstr ""
"Hier ist der Kommunikationsoffizier von {target_callsign}.  Sprechen Sie, "
"{source_callsign}.  Wir hören zu."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:706
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"{target_callsign} to {source_callsign}, receiving your communication.  "
"Proceed with your message."
msgstr ""
"{target_callsign} an {source_callsign}, wir empfangen Ihre Kommunikation.  "
"Fahren Sie mit Ihrer Nachricht fort."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:707
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"Confirmed, {source_callsign}.  You're connected to {target_callsign}.  Go "
"ahead."
msgstr ""
"Bestätigt, {source_callsign}.  Sie sind mit {target_callsign} verbunden.  "
"Sprechen Sie."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:708
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"This is the {target_callsign} communications officer.  Go ahead, "
"{source_callsign}."
msgstr ""
"Hier ist der Kommunikationsoffizier von {target_callsign}.  Sprechen Sie, "
"{source_callsign}."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:709
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"{target_callsign} acknowledges {source_callsign}'s communication.  Pray, "
"don't keep us in suspense any longer."
msgstr ""
"{target_callsign} bestätigt die Kommunikation von {source_callsign}.  Bitte "
"lassen Sie uns nicht länger im Ungewissen."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:710
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"{source_callsign}, it is positively thrilling to be the recipient of your "
"undoubtedly important message.  Please enlighten us."
msgstr ""
"{source_callsign}, es ist geradezu berauschend, Empfänger Ihrer zweifellos "
"wichtigen Nachricht zu sein.  Bitte klären Sie uns auf."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:711
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"Acknowledged, {source_callsign}.  Try not to waste our time.  What do you "
"want?"
msgstr ""
"Bestätigt, {source_callsign}.  Versuchen Sie, unsere Zeit nicht zu "
"verschwenden.  Was wollen Sie?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:712
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"What is it now, {source_callsign}?  Make it quick; we're not here for small "
"talk."
msgstr ""
"Was ist es diesmal, {source_callsign}?  Fassen Sie sich kurz; wir sind nicht "
"zum Plaudern hier."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:713
msgctxt "greeted-by-station-undocked"
msgid ""
"{target_callsign} reluctantly acknowledges your communication.  Make it "
"snappy, {source_callsign}."
msgstr ""
"{target_callsign} bestätigt widerwillig Ihre Kommunikation.  Fassen Sie sich "
"kurz, {source_callsign}."

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:718
msgctxt "special-comms"
msgid "You are our declared enemy. What do you want?"
msgstr "Sie sind unser erklärter Feind. Was wollen Sie?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:738
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Informationen"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:739
msgid "I need information"
msgstr "Ich brauche Informationen"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:740
msgid "Ask questions"
msgstr "Fragen stellen"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:741
msgid "I need to know what you know"
msgstr "Ich muss wissen, was Sie wissen"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:746
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What kind of information do you want?"
msgstr "Welche Art von Informationen möchten Sie?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:747
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What kind of information do you need?"
msgstr "Welche Art von Informationen benötigen Sie?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:748
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What kind of information do you seek?"
msgstr "Welche Art von Informationen suchen Sie?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:749
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What kind of information are you looking for?"
msgstr "Nach welcher Art von Informationen suchen Sie?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:750
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What kind of information are you interested in?"
msgstr "Für welche Art von Informationen interessieren Sie sich?"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:756
msgid "Report station status"
msgstr "Stationsstatus melden"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:759
msgid "Here is our status:\n"
msgstr "Hier ist unser Status:\n"

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:760
#, lua-format
msgctxt "situationReport-comms"
msgid "Hull:%s%%    "
msgstr "Rumpf:%s%%    "

#: mod_spacelan/comms/comms_vf_station.lua:763
#, lua-format
